hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"988","Muhammad bin Bashar told us, Yahya bin Saeed told me, Yazid bin Kaysan told us, Abu Hazim told me, on the authority of Abu Hurairah, he said: We were given a wedding. With the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, and we did not wake up until the sun had risen. Then the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “Let every person take At the head of his mount, this is a place where Satan came to us, so we did so. He called for water, performed ablution, then prayed two prostrations, then the prayer was performed. Prayer is the morning prayer.”"
